      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Usage:\n\n1. The transmission can be started only after adding hypoid gear oil.\n2 install the granulator smoothly, adjust the tightness of the belt, whether the steering meets the requirements, whether the screws in each part are loose,\nLoosen the gap adjusting screw on the roller shaft seat to make the feed in a non-load state, and put it into use after starting normal operation.\n3 before using the new machine for the first time, take grass powder of 10 Jin and mix the vegetable oil to twist the gap adjusting screw to make the two rolling speeds consistent. Gradually\nAdd the refueling feed, and continue to twist pinch roller adjustable screws at the same time until the particles are slowly produced, and the extruded particles are repeatedly rolled and squeezed to make the mold\nAfter the hole lubrication is smooth, slowly add the mixed feed to be processed for processing. For example, it feels that the hole resistance of the mold is large and the output is low.\nOr no material, the template can be repeatedly ground according to the above method, so that the mold hole is smooth and then processed.\n4 if there are more refined fibers during feed processing, add about water. If there are more refined materials in the mixed feed, add less as appropriate.\nWater volume, after processing, add a little oil mixed with edible oil in advance, which is conducive to the next startup and avoids the feed after shutdown.\nIn the hole.\n5 after processing, loosen the gap adjusting screw to make the roller in a free state. After stopping, clear up and down, especially the remaining material under rejection plate,\nIn order to avoid damage to the pumping bearing.\nMachine packaging size: 150*76 ** 50cm\nMachine weight: 95kg\nInput Voltage：220v\n\n💗  The default size of the grinding disc hole is 4mm.（If you need a 2.5mm/3mm/6mm/8mm grinding disc, please contact customer service）",
