    "product_description": {
      "paragraph_list": [
        {
          "text": "Usage:",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "1. The transmission can be started only after adding hypoid gear oil.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "2 install the granulator smoothly, adjust the tightness of the belt, whether the steering meets the requirements, whether the screws in each part are loose,",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Loosen the gap adjusting screw on the roller shaft seat to make the feed in a non-load state, and put it into use after starting normal operation.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "3 before using the new machine for the first time, take grass powder of 10 Jin and mix the vegetable oil to twist the gap adjusting screw to make the two rolling speeds consistent. Gradually",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Add the refueling feed, and continue to twist pinch roller adjustable screws at the same time until the particles are slowly produced, and the extruded particles are repeatedly rolled and squeezed to make the mold",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "After the hole lubrication is smooth, slowly add the mixed feed to be processed for processing. For example, it feels that the hole resistance of the mold is large and the output is low.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Or no material, the template can be repeatedly ground according to the above method, so that the mold hole is smooth and then processed.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "4 if there are more refined fibers during feed processing, add about water. If there are more refined materials in the mixed feed, add less as appropriate.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Water volume, after processing, add a little oil mixed with edible oil in advance, which is conducive to the next startup and avoids the feed after shutdown.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "In the hole.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
